The epiora-mdb wasm module in this directory (mdb.js, mdb.wasm)
contains libmdb from mdbtools 1.0.1, which is licensed under the GNU
Lesser General Public License (the mdbtools COPYING.LIB is the
LGPL-2.0 text; mdbtools source headers grant "version 2 or later",
commonly labelled LGPL-2.1-or-later).

The full licence text is reproduced verbatim at
crates/epiora-mdb/LICENSE-mdbtools in this repository and from the
Free Software Foundation:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.0.html

Under LGPL §2(a): the module contains mdbtools unmodified except for
the two patches recorded in crates/epiora-mdb/NOTICE
(a `MdbColumn.is_null` field and the one-line `_mdb_attempt_bind`
assignment that sets it). The files carrying those changes are
prominently marked in that NOTICE, with this change dated to the
v1.1 Task 5 implementation (2026-11-23).

Under LGPL §6: this module is statically linked with libmdb. It is
distributed alongside this source-offer (see SOURCE-OFFER next to
this file) so it can be relinked against a modified libmdb.
